sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant A as Authenticator
  participant G as Mutation Gate
  participant R as Redis
  participant L as Audit Ledger
  participant OP as On-call
  participant DD as Datadog
  participant J as Jira

  DD->>GW: Webhook request
  GW->>A: Request
  A->>G: Authenticated event asks for mutation
  G->>R: Read completed key / acquire lock
  R--xG: Timeout or unavailable
  G->>L: Record idempotency-unknown (scrubbed)
  G->>G: Set gate PAUSED
  G-->>GW: 503; no Jira call
  GW-->>DD: 503; provider may retry
  G->>OP: Page platform/security owner
  OP->>R: Restore/fail over Redis under approved procedure
  OP->>L: Record recovery and evidence reference
  OP->>G: Keep paused until reconciliation passes
  G->>R: Reconcile event key
  R-->>G: No prior completion / or known completion
  alt No prior completion
    G->>J: Permit one bounded retry after review
    J-->>G: Result
  else Prior completion found
    G->>L: Mark duplicate reconciled
  end
  G->>G: Reopen gate only after synthetic validation
  G-->>DD: Subsequent requests handled normally

