sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Mutation Worker
  participant J as Jira
  participant R as Redis
  participant L as Audit Ledger
  participant OP as On-call

  W->>J: Create/update bounded corrective action
  J--xW: Timeout after possible commit
  W->>L: Record unknown external outcome
  W->>R: Do not mark completed; retain reconciliation state
  W->>OP: Page with event fingerprint only
  OP->>J: Search by deterministic external alert key
  alt Jira issue exists
    J-->>OP: Existing issue key
    OP->>R: Store reconciled completion record
    OP->>L: Record reconciliation; no retry mutation
  else No Jira issue exists
    OP->>W: Authorize one bounded retry
    W->>J: Retry with same deterministic external key
    J-->>W: Success or bounded failure
    W->>R: Store completion only after audit policy is satisfied
    W->>L: Record final outcome
  end

